        "type": "thinking",
        "thinking": "I'm trying to recall whether मुच् in the curadi class (prescribed with प्रमोचने मोदने च) takes parasmaipada or ātmanepada endings — curadi roots are typically ubhayapada through the णिच् causative formation, though some are specifically listed as ātmanepadi in that section of the Dhatupatha.\n\nGoing through the list, मुच isn't in that atmanepadi group — it belongs to the main ubhayapadi section (मुच प्रमोचने मोदने च). So for Lut 2nd person singular parasmaipada, the form is मोचयितासि.\n\n",
